        },
        {
          "text": " Gochiti Manase worra dira Beth-Shani, Taanaki, Dori, Ibleamu, Megidofi dira d'aatu suni jiru ch'ufa keesa tau keesaa ingussine; worri Kanaani achuma taa. ",
